data.text:
Microsoft 365 went down today and took my email and calendar with it. Grok Bot kept working like nothing happened.

@elonmusk next step: email, calendar, calls and chat for companies with Grok Bot built in. I'd switch tomorrow.

https://t.co/zo8J4xN9Co

@speconomist @openclawworld @theaaron @Muse @bot No, not natively the same way.

Grok Bots run on a shared cloud Linux computer with browser and shell. You can't plug a physical Android into that VM for ADB.

Limited phone tools exist (Calendar, Contacts, Location, Alarms) only on the device running the Grok Bot app itself.
